        thirdDose: `Chai 3: ${dose3Mg.toLocaleString()} mg (${(dose3Mg / 1e3).toFixed(1)} g) pha trong 1000 mL Dextrose 5% truy\u1EC1n TM li\xEAn t\u1EE5c trong 16 gi\u1EDD (t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 ~62.5 mL/h).`,
        totalDose: `T\u1ED5ng li\u1EC1u to\xE0n ph\xE1c \u0111\u1ED3 21h: ${totalDoseMg.toLocaleString()} mg (${(totalDoseMg / 1e3).toFixed(1)} g) t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u01B0\u01A1ng 300 mg/kg theo c\xE2n n\u1EB7ng ${effectiveWeight} kg.`
