        "Albumin v\xE0 PT/INR l\xE0 hai th\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111o chu\u1EA9n x\xE1c nh\u1EA5t v\u1EC1 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng t\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p c\u1EE7a gan tr\xEAn l\xE2m s\xE0ng.",
