      contentMarkdown: `### 1. V\xEC Sao Thay \u0110\u1ED5i Danh Ph\xE1p T\u1EEB NAFLD Sang MASLD?
V\xE0o n\u0103m 2023-2024, c\xE1c hi\u1EC7p h\u1ED9i gan m\u1EADt h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi (AASLD, EASL, ALEH) \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c **\u0110\u1ED3ng thu\u1EADn Delphi \u0110a h\u1ED9i** thay th\u1EBF thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF NAFLD (Non-Alcoholic Fatty Liver Disease) b\u1EB1ng **MASLD (Metabolic Dysfunction-associated Steatotic Liver Disease)** v\xEC c\xE1c l\xFD do ch\xEDnh:
* Tr\xE1nh thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF mang t\xEDnh k\u1EF3 th\u1ECB ("Fatty" v\xE0 "Alcoholic").
* X\xE1c l\u1EADp vai tr\xF2 ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a c\xE1c **ti\xEAu chu\u1EA9n tim m\u1EA1ch - chuy\u1EC3n h\xF3a (Cardiometabolic criteria)** thay v\xEC ch\u1EA9n \u0111o\xE1n lo\u1EA1i tr\u1EEB ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c.
* \u0110\u1ECBnh danh nh\xF3m b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n c\xF3 s\u1EF1 ch\u1ED3ng l\u1EA5p gi\u1EEFa chuy\u1EC3n h\xF3a v\xE0 r\u01B0\u1EE3u: **MetALD**.

### 2. Ti\xEAu Chu\u1EA9n Tim M\u1EA1ch - Chuy\u1EC3n H\xF3a (Cardiometabolic Risk Factors)
B\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n c\xF3 b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng gan tho\xE1i h\xF3a m\u1EE1 (tr\xEAn si\xEAu \xE2m, CT, MRI ho\u1EB7c m\xF4 h\u1ECDc) \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\u1EBFp v\xE0o ph\u1ED5 SLD n\u1EBFu c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t **1 trong 5 ti\xEAu ch\xED**:
1. **Th\u1EEBa c\xE2n / B\xE9o ph\xEC**: BMI \u2265 25 kg/m\xB2 (ho\u1EB7c \u2265 23 kg/m\xB2 \u1EDF ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\xE2u \xC1) ho\u1EB7c v\xF2ng b\u1EE5ng > 94 cm (nam), > 80 cm (n\u1EEF).
2. **R\u1ED1i lo\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng huy\u1EBFt**: \u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng huy\u1EBFt \u0111\xF3i \u2265 100 mg/dL (5.6 mmol/L) ho\u1EB7c HbA1c \u2265 5.7% ho\u1EB7c \u0111ang \u0111i\u1EC1u tr\u1ECB \u0110T\u0110 Type 2.
3. **T\u0103ng huy\u1EBFt \xE1p**: Huy\u1EBFt \xE1p \u2265 130/85 mmHg ho\u1EB7c \u0111ang d\xF9ng thu\u1ED1c h\u1EA1 \xE1p.
4. **T\u0103ng Triglyceride m\xE1u**: Triglyceride \u2265 150 mg/dL (1.7 mmol/L) ho\u1EB7c \u0111ang \u0111i\u1EC1u tr\u1ECB h\u1EA1 m\u1EE1 m\xE1u.
5. **Gi\u1EA3m HDL-Cholesterol**: HDL < 40 mg/dL (1.0 mmol/L) \u1EDF nam, < 50 mg/dL (1.3 mmol/L) \u1EDF n\u1EEF.

### 3. Ph\xE2n \u0110\u1ECBnh Ranh Gi\u1EDBi Ti\xEAu Th\u1EE5 R\u01B0\u1EE3u (Alcohol Thresholds)
* **MASLD thu\u1EA7n t\xFAy**: Th\u1ECFa ti\xEAu chu\u1EA9n chuy\u1EC3n h\xF3a + u\u1ED1ng r\u01B0\u1EE3u t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u:
  * N\u1EEF: < 140 g/tu\u1EA7n (< 20 g/ng\xE0y, t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u01B0\u01A1ng < 17.5 \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB c\u1ED3n UK/tu\u1EA7n).
  * Nam: < 210 g/tu\u1EA7n (< 30 g/ng\xE0y, t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u01B0\u01A1ng < 26.25 \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB c\u1ED3n UK/tu\u1EA7n).
* **MetALD (Th\u1EC3 h\u1ED7n h\u1EE3p chuy\u1EC3n h\xF3a & r\u01B0\u1EE3u)**: Th\u1ECFa ti\xEAu chu\u1EA9n chuy\u1EC3n h\xF3a NH\u01AFNG c\xF3 m\u1EE9c u\u1ED1ng r\u01B0\u1EE3u trung b\xECnh:
  * N\u1EEF: 140 \u2013 350 g/tu\u1EA7n (20 \u2013 50 g/ng\xE0y, ho\u1EB7c 17.5 \u2013 43.75 \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB UK/tu\u1EA7n).
  * Nam: 210 \u2013 420 g/tu\u1EA7n (30 \u2013 60 g/ng\xE0y, ho\u1EB7c 26.25 \u2013 52.5 \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB UK/tu\u1EA7n).
  * *\xDD ngh\u0129a l\xE2m s\xE0ng*: Nh\xF3m n\xE0y c\xF3 t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 ti\u1EBFn tri\u1EC3n x\u01A1 h\xF3a v\xE0 x\u01A1 gan nhanh h\u01A1n g\u1EA5p 2-3 l\u1EA7n so v\u1EDBi MASLD \u0111\u01A1n thu\u1EA7n.
* **ALD (B\u1EC7nh gan li\xEAn quan r\u01B0\u1EE3u thu\u1EA7n t\xFAy)**:
  * N\u1EEF > 350 g/tu\u1EA7n (> 50 g/ng\xE0y), Nam > 420 g/tu\u1EA7n (> 60 g/ng\xE0y), ho\u1EB7c s\xE0ng l\u1ECDc AUDIT-C \u2265 5.

### 4. Thang \u0110i\u1EC3m \u0110\xE1nh Gi\xE1 X\u01A1 H\xF3a Kh\xF4ng X\xE2m L\u1EA5n: FIB-4 & NFS
Theo H\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn H\u1ED9i Ti\xEAu h\xF3a Anh (**BSG 2018 - Gut 2018;67:6-19**) v\xE0 **BMJ 2025**:
* **NAFLD Fibrosis Score (NFS)**:
  $$\\text{NFS} = -1.675 + 0.037 \\times \\text{Tu\u1ED5i} + 0.094 \\times \\text{BMI} + 1.13 \\times \\text{IFG/\u0110T\u0110} + 0.99 \\times (\\text{AST/ALT}) - 0.013 \\times \\text{Ti\u1EC3u c\u1EA7u} - 0.66 \\times \\text{Albumin}$$
  * Tu\u1ED5i < 65: Ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng lo\u1EA1i tr\u1EEB x\u01A1 h\xF3a l\xE0 < -1.455 (NPV ~90%).
  * **Tu\u1ED5i \u2265 65 (Hi\u1EC7u ch\u1EC9nh BSG 2018)**: Ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng lo\u1EA1i tr\u1EEB \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xE2ng l\xEAn **< 0.12**!
* **FIB-4 Index**:
  * Tu\u1ED5i < 65: Nguy c\u01A1 th\u1EA5p < 1.30; Nguy c\u01A1 cao > 2.67.
  * **Tu\u1ED5i \u2265 65 (Hi\u1EC7u ch\u1EC9nh BSG 2018 & BMJ 2025)**: Ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng nguy c\u01A1 th\u1EA5p \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xE2ng l\xEAn **< 2.00** \u0111\u1EC3 tr\xE1nh chuy\u1EC3n tuy\u1EBFn qu\xE1 m\u1EE9c kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt do sinh l\xFD l\xE3o h\xF3a.

### 5. An To\xE0n C\u1EE7a Thu\u1ED1c H\u1EA1 M\u1EE1 Nh\xF3m Statin Tr\xEAn B\u1EC7nh Gan
* **Quy t\u1EAFc < 3x ULN**: Theo BSG 2018 v\xE0 BMJ 2025, statin **HO\xC0N TO\xC0N AN TO\xC0N** khi transaminase < 3 l\u1EA7n ULN.
* Nguy c\u01A1 t\u1EED vong h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u \u1EDF b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n MASLD l\xE0 **bi\u1EBFn c\u1ED1 tim m\u1EA1ch** (nh\u1ED3i m\xE1u c\u01A1 tim, \u0111\u1ED9t qu\u1EF5), ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i suy gan. Vi\u1EC7c ng\u01B0ng statin kh\xF4ng \u0111\xFAng ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh l\xE0m t\u0103ng \u0111\xE1ng k\u1EC3 nguy c\u01A1 t\u1EED vong tim m\u1EA1ch.
* Th\u1EADm ch\xED, statin c\xF2n l\xE0m gi\u1EA3m vi\xEAm gan tho\xE1i h\xF3a m\u1EE1 v\xE0 gi\u1EA3m nguy c\u01A1 ung th\u01B0 bi\u1EC3u m\xF4 t\u1EBF b\xE0o gan (HCC).`,
