        "Amoxicillin-Clavulanate l\xE0 nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n DILI h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE0 th\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\u1EDFi ph\xE1t sau khi \u0111\xE3 ng\u01B0ng thu\u1ED1c v\xE0i tu\u1EA7n.",
